sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant EmployeeUI as Employee App
    actor Master as Wellness Admin
    participant MasterUI as Wellness Admin App

    Master->>MasterUI: Interaction 0 - Save NOWNodes configuration
    MasterUI-->>Master: Configuration verified and ready
    Employee->>EmployeeUI: Interaction 1 - Enter name and phone
    Employee->>EmployeeUI: Interaction 2 - Start activation
    EmployeeUI-->>Employee: Interaction 3 - Show request QR
    Master->>MasterUI: Interaction 4 - Scan or import request QR
    MasterUI-->>Master: Interaction 5 - Show Employee review
    Master->>MasterUI: Interaction 6 - Approve setup
    MasterUI-->>Master: Interaction 7 - Show response QR with protected configuration
    Employee->>EmployeeUI: Interaction 8 - Scan or import response QR
    EmployeeUI-->>Employee: Interaction 9 - Show activation review
    Employee->>EmployeeUI: Interaction 10 - Approve activation
    EmployeeUI-->>Employee: Interaction 11 - Install configuration and show verified Wellness Points
